      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1369008823,
      "text": "Paraserianthes lophantha, the Cape Leeuwin wattle, Bicol wattle, Cape wattle, Crested wattle, Brush wattle or plume albizia, is a fast-growing tree with creamy-yellow, bottlebrush like flowers. It is the sole species in genus Paraserianthes."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Paraserianthes lophantha",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paraserianthes_lophantha",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 161196567,
      "text": "Paraserianthes lophantha es una especie de leguminosa en la familia de las Fabaceae. También se conoce como Albicia amarilla, Acacia plumosa o Albizia de plumas. Es originaria de Australia."
    },
    "pt": {
